                    "text": "Format: Pyramidal OME-TIFF (BigTIFF 64-bit Streaming)\nProfile: Pap-LBC Cervical Smear (12mm Inscribed Circle)\nObjective: 20X Plan Achromat (0.25 µm/pixel)",
